{"name":"BooleanAnalysis.parseval","v":1,"source_hash":"34bf036eb458e87a","lines":["n : ℕ","f : BooleanFunc n","⊢ innerProduct f f = ∑ S, fourierCoeff f S ^ 2","expand : innerProduct f f = ∑ S, ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * innerProduct (chiS S) (chiS T)","⊢ innerProduct f f = ∑ S, ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * innerProduct (chiS S) (chiS T)","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, f x * f x =","    ∑ x, ∑ x_1, fourierCoeff f x * fourierCoeff f x_1 * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x_2, chiS x x_2 * chiS x_1 x_2)","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, (∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) * ∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x =","x : BoolCube n","⊢ f x * f x = (∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, (∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x =","    ∑ S, ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS S x * chiS T x)","⊢ ∑ i, 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S i) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f T * chiS T i) =","⊢ ∑ x, ∑ S, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x)) =","⊢ ∑ x, 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x) =","    ∑ x, ∑ S, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x))","⊢ ∀ x ∈ Finset.univ,","    2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x) =","      ∑ S, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x))","a✝ : x ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ((∑ S, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x) * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x) =","    ∑ S, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x))","⊢ x ∈ Finset.univ →","⊢ ∑ i, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f i * chiS i x * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x) =","⊢ ∀ x_1 ∈ Finset.univ,","    2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f x_1 * chiS x_1 x * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x) =","      ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f x_1 * chiS x_1 x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x))","a✝¹ : x ∈ Finset.univ","S : Finset (Fin n)","a✝ : S ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x) =","    ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x))","⊢ S ∈ Finset.univ →","    2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x) =","      ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x))","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x) =","⊢ ∑ y, ∑ x, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f y * chiS y x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x)) =","    ∑ x_1, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f x * chiS x x_1 * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x_1)) =","      ∑ T, fourierCoeff f x * fourierCoeff f T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x_1, chiS x x_1 * chiS T x_1)","⊢ ∑ x, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x)) =","    ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS S x * chiS T x)","    ∑ x, ∑ T, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x)) =","      ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS S x * chiS T x)","⊢ ∑ y, ∑ x, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f y * chiS y x)) =","    ∑ x_1, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x_1 * (fourierCoeff f x * chiS x x_1)) =","      fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f x * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x_1, chiS S x_1 * chiS x x_1)","a✝¹ : S ∈ Finset.univ","T : Finset (Fin n)","a✝ : T ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ ∑ x, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x)) =","    fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS S x * chiS T x)","⊢ T ∈ Finset.univ →","    ∑ x, 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x)) =","      fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * ∑ x, chiS S x * chiS T x)","⊢ ∑ x, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS S x * chiS T x)) =","    ∑ x, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS S x * chiS T x))","    2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x)) =","      fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS S x * chiS T x))","a✝² : S ∈ Finset.univ","a✝¹ : T ∈ Finset.univ","⊢ 2⁻¹ ^ n * (fourierCoeff f S * chiS S x * (fourierCoeff f T * chiS T x)) =","    fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * (2⁻¹ ^ n * (chiS S x * chiS T x))","⊢ ∑ S, ∑ T, fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * innerProduct (chiS S) (chiS T) = ∑ S, fourierCoeff f S ^ 2","⊢ (∑ x, ∑ x_1, if x = x_1 then fourierCoeff f x * fourierCoeff f x_1 else 0) = ∑ S, fourierCoeff f S ^ 2","⊢ ∑ x, fourierCoeff f x * fourierCoeff f x = ∑ S, fourierCoeff f S ^ 2","⊢ ∀ x ∈ Finset.univ, fourierCoeff f x * fourierCoeff f x = fourierCoeff f x ^ 2","⊢ fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f S = fourierCoeff f S ^ 2","⊢ S ∈ Finset.univ → fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f S = fourierCoeff f S ^ 2"],"goals":[[0,1,2],[0,1,3,2],[0,1,4],[0,1,5,6],[0,1,7,6],[0,1,8,9],[0,1,10,11],[0,1,12,11],[0,1,13,11],[0,1,14,15],[0,1,16,17,18],[0,1,8,19,20,21],[0,1,8,22,17,18],[0,1,8,19,23,21],[0,1,8,19,24,25,26],[0,1,8,27,28,29,30,31],[0,1,8,19,28,32,33,34],[0,1,8,27,28,29,35,31],[0,1,36,11],[0,1,16,37,38],[0,1,28,29,39,40],[0,1,28,32,41,42],[0,1,28,29,43,40],[0,1,28,29,16,44,45],[0,1,28,46,47,48,49,50],[0,1,28,29,47,51,52,53],[0,1,28,46,47,48,54,50],[0,1,28,46,47,48,49,55],[0,1,28,46,47,48,16,56,57],[0,1,28,58,47,59,8,19,60,61],[0,1,28,46,47,48,8,22,56,57],[0,1,3,62],[0,1,3,63],[0,1,3,64],[0,1,3,65],[0,1,3,28,29,66],[0,1,3,28,67]],"steps":[{"line":10,"col":2,"end_line":57,"end_col":49,"tactic":"have expand :\n  innerProduct f f =\n    ∑ S : Finset (Fin n), ∑ T : Finset (Fin n), fourierCoeff f S * fourierCoeff f T * innerProduct (chiS S) (chiS T) :=\n  by\n  -- Expand innerProduct and uniformWeight first so f x * f x becomes visible\n   …","before":[0],"after":[1],"used":["Finset.fintype","Eq.mpr","Finset.mul_sum","Real","NonUnitalCommRing.toNonUnitalNonAssocCommRing","BooleanAnalysis.BoolCube","Bool.fintype","HMul.hMul","CommRing.toNonUnitalCommRing","Fi